{"title": "Samsung Galaxy Watch Ultra 2 vs Watch 9: When is it right to spend more?", "link": "https://9to5google.com/2026/11/22/samsung-galaxy-watch-ultra-2-vs-watch-9-when-is-it-right-to-spend-more/", "summary": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5google.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/07/Galaxy-Watch-9-and-Watch-Ultra-2-v1.jpg?quality=82&strip=all&w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The <a href=\"https://go.sylikes.com/fbgdGQcudqjy\" rel=\"sponsored nofollow\">Samsung Galaxy Watch Ultra 2</a> is worth spending more on if you want longer battery life, a brighter outdoor display, and specialized features for trail running and diving. The Galaxy Watch 9 is the better fit if you want Samsung’s latest everyday health tools in a smaller, lighter watch.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Both, however, are fantastic smartwatches with limitless potential. They share a Snapdragon Wear Elite processor and many of Samsung’s newest wellness features, so deciding between them is really about figuring out your priorities when it comes to buying a wearable this holiday season. We’re here to help you figure that out.</p>\n\n\n\n <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/11/22/samsung-galaxy-watch-ultra-2-vs-watch-9-when-is-it-right-to-spend-more/#more-737255\">more…</a>", "published": "2026-11-22T05:26:51+00:00", "source": "9to5Google", "category": "subscription", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-11-22T17:44:42.485929+00:00", "ontology": {"repo": "SubscriptionRadar", "category": "subscription", "ontology_version": "0.1.0", "evidence_policy_ids": ["traceable_url_required", "cross_reference_required", "non_authoritative_context_only"]}}
{"title": "The Google Home app is better than Nest alone ever was, mostly", "link": "https://9to5google.com/2026/11/22/google-home-app-better-than-nest/", "summary": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5google.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/05/google-home-app-android-1.jpg?quality=82&strip=all&w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The Nest app is officially dead, but it’s worth taking a step back and remembering that, while there are some rough edges, the Google Home app is a better smart home experience than Nest alone ever could have been.</p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left wp-block-paragraph\"><em>9to5Google Weekender by Ben Schoon is a part of our free newsletter that also includes ‘Inbox,’ a twice-weekly roundup of key stories from around the web by Daniel Bader. <a href=\"https://9to5google.beehiiv.com/subscribe\">Sign up here</a> to get Weekender delivered to your inbox every Sunday along with ‘Inbox’ on Tuesday and Thursday. <a href=\"https://9to5google.com/feature/newsletter/\">You can find past issues here</a>.</em></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>Sign up below to access the web version.</em></p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n\n\n\n <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/11/22/google-home-app-better-than-nest/#more-739186\">more…</a>", "published": "2026-11-22T05:00:00+00:00", "source": "9to5Google", "category": "subscription", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-11-22T17:44:42.485929+00:00", "ontology": {"repo": "SubscriptionRadar", "category": "subscription", "ontology_version": "0.1.0", "evidence_policy_ids": ["traceable_url_required", "cross_reference_required", "non_authoritative_context_only"]}}
{"title": "Gemini app rolls out very slick camera redesign on Android", "link": "https://9to5google.com/2026/11/21/gemini-camera-redesign/", "summary": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5google.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/05/gemini-app-4.jpg?quality=82&strip=all&w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Google has thoroughly redesigned Gemini for Android’s in-app camera that lets you quickly add an image to prompts.</p>\n\n\n\n <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/11/21/gemini-camera-redesign/#more-739420\">more…</a>", "published": "2026-11-21T11:52:52+00:00", "source": "9to5Google", "category": "subscription", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-11-22T17:44:42.485929+00:00", "ontology": {"repo": "SubscriptionRadar", "category": "subscription", "ontology_version": "0.1.0", "evidence_policy_ids": ["traceable_url_required", "cross_reference_required", "non_authoritative_context_only"]}}
{"title": "Galaxy Z Fold 8 features: What you can do on a foldable", "link": "https://9to5google.com/2026/11/21/galaxy-z-fold-8-features-what-you-can-do/", "summary": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5google.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/10/Galaxy-Z-Fold-8-lavender-2.jpg?quality=82&strip=all&w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Folding phones have come in numerous variations over the years as the concept has evolved. The Galaxy Z Fold 8 is the latest evolution that introduces a form factor that fits every user. Its unique design makes it a foldable most people can actually use – which makes it a perfect gift. You might be surprised by what it can do.</p>\n\n\n\n <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/11/21/galaxy-z-fold-8-features-what-you-can-do/#more-734800\">more…</a>", "published": "2026-11-21T08:00:00+00:00", "source": "9to5Google", "category": "subscription", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-11-22T17:44:42.485929+00:00", "ontology": {"repo": "SubscriptionRadar", "category": "subscription", "ontology_version": "0.1.0", "evidence_policy_ids": ["traceable_url_required", "cross_reference_required", "non_authoritative_context_only"]}}
{"title": "Samsung might copy the iPhone’s Dynamic Island soon, but it actually looks good [Video]", "link": "https://9to5google.com/2026/11/20/samsung-iphone-dynamic-island-feature-leak/", "summary": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5google.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/02/galaxy-s26-ultra-privacy-display-20.jpg?quality=82&strip=all&w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A new leak suggests that Samsung is preparing to copy the iPhone’s Dynamic Island feature in the not-too-distant future, to an extent that not many other Android brands have even done thus far.</p>\n\n\n\n <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/11/20/samsung-iphone-dynamic-island-feature-leak/#more-739409\">more…</a>", "published": "2026-11-20T17:45:00+00:00", "source": "9to5Google", "category": "subscription", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-11-22T17:44:42.485929+00:00", "ontology": {"repo": "SubscriptionRadar", "category": "subscription", "ontology_version": "0.1.0", "evidence_policy_ids": ["traceable_url_required", "cross_reference_required", "non_authoritative_context_only"]}}
